{"rows":[{"cols":[{"designInfo":{"stencilSuperIds":["Output"],"stencilId":"cloud-output"},"label":"Configure Data X-Ray Workflows","value":"<p>This admin workflow sets up everything the Data X-Ray sync &amp; search workflows need, in one step. It is <b>idempotent</b> — anything that already exists is left untouched, so it is safe to run again.</p><p><b>It will ensure the following exist (creating them with fixed IDs if missing):</b></p><ul><li>the <b>Collibra to Data xRay Integration</b> community</li><li>the <b>Data xRay Classifications</b> and <b>Data xRay Custom Queries</b> domains</li><li>the <b>Classification, Annotator, Extractor, Label</b> and <b>Unstructured Data Query</b> asset types</li><li>the <b>Link, Search Link, Sub Type, Data X-Ray ID</b> and <b>Files</b> attribute types, and assignments so they show on the asset pages</li></ul><p>The <b>Sync Data X-Ray Classifications</b>, <b>Sync Data X-Ray Classification (Nightly)</b> and <b>Search Data X-Ray</b> workflows reference these elements by fixed ID, so once they exist there is nothing further to configure.</p><p><b>You still set the Data X-Ray Base URL and Bearer token by hand</b> on each of those three workflows — those are their only settings, and this workflow never touches them.</p><p>Click <b>Send</b> to run it. A <b>Configuration Results</b> task will then appear in your task inbox listing what was created, skipped and configured.</p>","defaultValue":false,"size":12,"ignore":false,"visible":true,"enabled":true,"isRequired":false,"id":"startConfigureInfo","type":"htmlComponent"}]}],"metadata":{"key":"startConfigureForm","name":"Configure Data X-Ray Workflows","description":"Confirmation screen shown before the Data X-Ray operating-model bootstrap runs.","version":"1","modelType":"form","flowableDesignVersion":3110,"palette":"flowable-core-form-palette"}}
